        "description": {
          "en-US": "Fork of FreeOTP. The list holds only key names, never secrets. Tap a key,\ntype a password and numpwd shows the output of\n\nopenssl passwd -6 -salt KEYNAME | tr -dc '[0-9]'\n\nbyte for byte, with a copy button. The result closes after a minute and\nthe clipboard is cleared after 30 seconds."
